libxmp
======

This directory is a Buildroot recipe. It does not relicense upstream.
Software built by this recipe: fetched upstream source
Declared SPDX / license field: LGPL-2.1+
Upstream / origin: https://github.com/libxmp/libxmp

Recipe files (.mk, Config.in) are packaging for Zlyme.
Patches of GPL/LGPL sources follow those upstream licenses.
